Icons in this folder
====================

Files copied from Hugeicons (Stroke Rounded set), via monoBOT:
  add-01, bot, chatting, check, chevron-down-2, chevron-up, clock,
  cursor-magic, dashboard, eye, file, folder-01, folder-open, folder-tree,
  gauge, globe, help-circle, keyboard, list-bullet, loader, mic-01,
  minus-sign, more-horizontal, package, panel-bottom, panel-left,
  panel-right, pencil-edit, play, refresh-cw, search-01, sliders, sparkles,
  square-fill, star, trash, undo, wand, window-maximize, window-restore, x

